# a6443: the music panel in Spotify's look (home-music, home-music-full, home-music-keys, home-music-time). It is Spotify's own surface inside the home base, as an embedded player is: its own dark palette (sp*), whatever theme the home base wears, the art rounded, the title strong, the artist grey, white controls with a round white play. Spotify's green is a STATE only (liked, shuffle or repeat on, playing): its own token, not the theme's accent, which means an agent at work. Nothing moves; the bar steps once a second. To follow the theme instead, point the sp* tokens at ink, soft, faint, raised, wash and night.
token spotify = #1ED760
token spbg = #121212
token spraised = #282828
token spink = #FFFFFF
token spsoft = #B3B3B3
token spfaint = #727272
token sphover = #FFFFFF1A
role mu : on spbg, spink, corner gap x1.5, pad gap x2, between gap
role muempty : between gap x1.5
role muartnone : spfaint, on spraised, width gap x8, pad gap x2, corner gap
role mutitle.quiet : text medium, spsoft
role mucard : between gap x1.5
role mutop : between gap x1.5
role muart : width gap x8, corner gap, align center
role muartpic : corner gap
role muartblank : spfaint, on spraised, width gap x8, pad gap x2, corner gap
role muwords : between gap /4
role mutitle : text strong, spink
role muartist : text down, spsoft
role muheart : spsoft, width gap x3, pad gap /4, corner gap x3, hover sphover, align center
role muheart.on : spotify, width gap x3, pad gap /4, corner gap x3, hover sphover, align center
role muheart.unknown : spfaint, width gap x3, pad gap /4, corner gap x3, hover sphover, align center
role mutime : between gap
role mutimenum : text down 2, spsoft, align center
role mubarbox : align center
role mubar : spfaint
role mubar.on : spink
role mukeysbox : align center
role mukeys : align center
role mukeyrow : between gap x2.5, align center
role mukey : spsoft, width gap x3, pad gap /4, corner gap x3, hover sphover, align center
role mukey.on : spotify, width gap x3, pad gap /4, corner gap x3, hover sphover, align center
role muplay : spbg, on spink, width gap x4, pad gap /1.25, corner gap x3, align center
role mufull : on spbg, spink, corner gap x2, pad gap x3, between gap x2
role mufullempty : between gap, pad gap x6, align center
role mufullnone : spfaint, width gap x8, align center
role mufulltitle.quiet : text up 2 medium, spsoft, align center
role mufullrow : between gap x5, pad gap x2
role mufullart : width gap x56, corner gap x1.5, lift gap x2, align center
role mufullpic : corner gap x1.5
role mufullblank : spfaint, on spraised, width gap x56, pad gap x14, corner gap x1.5
role mufullside : between gap x2
role musource : between gap
role mudot : spfaint, width gap, align center
role mudot.on : spotify, width gap, align center
role mulabel : text down 2 medium tracked, spsoft
role mufullhead : between gap x2
role mufulltitle : text up 3 strong, spink
role mufullartist : text up, spsoft
role muheartbig : spsoft, width gap x4.5, pad gap /2, corner gap x3, hover sphover, align center
role muheartbig.on : spotify, width gap x4.5, pad gap /2, corner gap x3, hover sphover, align center
role muheartbig.unknown : spfaint, width gap x4.5, pad gap /2, corner gap x3, hover sphover, align center
role muwhy : text down 2, spfaint
